      "background_kind": "curated",
      "heading": "6 · Dose honesty + Opt-out",
      "sentence": "Opt-out means: you may skip the embodied warm-up — sit quietly or jump to listing — no explanation. Dose honesty means: the lab used ~35 minutes; our classroom version is shorter and untested — never pretend the minutes match.",
      "image_brief": "A bandaged ear — technique has a cost; consent first.",
      "quote": "Adaptation is allowed. Pretending the minutes match is not.",
      "quote_origin": "tao_invented",
      "citation": {
        "label": "(Tao of Creativity)",
        "href": "/creativity-techniques-uem/lessons/en/master-lectures/self-creativity-attention/#tao-of-creativity"
      },
